              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunshidi yindi wudi nakubombelaku kudikaŋa, wudi nakutwetela makasa hankuma, wudi nakumuvulishila Nzambi mazu.",
          "type": "text",
